# The narrator spike's replies, ledger and Durable Object state (tools/ghost-spike.mjs, docs/spikes/4.1.md). Local only.
# Uncut model renders for the web hero media (web/public/media). The cut loops ship; the
# raw renders carry a burned-in vendor watermark and are kept locally as provenance only.
